  – Runtime: FALLBACK(G6.2, G6.1)  
  – Justification: If a human is available to open the door (G6.2), that option is used; if not, the robot opens the door (G6.1).

• G5 → G5.1, G5.2, G5.3  
  – Runtime: Parallel “#”  
  – Justification: Any one of the dish retrieval methods is sufficient to achieve the goal.

• G1 → All Tasks (AT1–AT9)  
  – Relation: AND  
  – Justification: Each task corresponds to an essential executable action required to complete the overall mission.

