Final Note

This goal model is intended to guide the design and planning of a multi‐robot system for inpatient food delivery. The decomposition reflects the mission’s decision points (e.g., delivery method and door opening) and the need for cooperation (human or multiple robots) in certain tasks. Adjustments may be required based on the actual system capabilities and environmental uncertainties.

Disclaimer: The above design is conceptual and should be validated and refined by qualified systems engineers and domain experts before implementation.
